	(text "BUZZER - external buzzer driver, 5 V\nPB6 (TIM4_CH1, AF2) -> 220R -> AO3400A gate.\nPads: BZ+ (5 V) and BZ- (MOSFET drain).\n\n10k gate pull-down: keeps the buzzer off at reset\n(PB6 floats after reset, RM0090 Rev 22, Section 8.3.1).\nB5819WS: flyback diode for magnetic buzzers.\n1k across the pads: discharge path for passive piezo buzzers.\nDesigned for 5 V buzzers up to 100 mA average.\n\nConnector = solder pads, not a component:\nexclude from BOM and position files."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 115.316 58.674 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.1588)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "57982069-d576-4f00-b16e-3fae08218b8f")
	)
